WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.400
You already use a broker, exchange, or market data service.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:10.300
TrueFix Studio brings those services into one desktop app.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:16.200
Compare prices and news, and open the original source when something needs checking.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:23.100
Ask the AI assistant to organize information, and test a strategy before using real money.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:29.300
Before sending a trade, check the account, order, fees, and risk.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:36.000
Market Twin is a future idea: compare possible routes and outcomes before a trade. Keep your accounts. Make the workflow clearer.
